   "body": "The betrayers for this quest seemed extremely scarce. Every other mob type spawned very well. [u]Prioritize Betrayers.[/u]\r\n\r\nAll of them use [spell=6925] at low health. Do not let them cast it, or [b]they'll go back to 100% Health[/b]. It's a physical ability, so Counterspell/Kick doesn't interrupt it; instead, just [b]burst[/b] them down or save a stun for it.",
